	(descr "DEUTSCH DT series 8-way VERTICAL (180 deg) sealed PCB receptacle with panel flange, DT15-08PA (key A, grey) / -08PB / -08PC / DT15-08PD (key D, brown) - dimensionally identical, only key + colour differ. Hand-derived from TE customer drawing C-DT15-08PX-XXXX rev A sheets 1-2 (RECOMMENDED PCB LAYOUT on sheet 2; mating-face view, key end at -y, PIN 1 bottom-left). Pins 8x dia 1.57 on two columns x=+/-4.56 (.359 [9.12] apart), rows y=+/-2.73 and +/-7.175 (.215 [5.46] middle gap, .565 [14.35] outer span); TE recommends dia 1.88 +0.13 holes after plating -> drill 2.0 / pad 2.8. Four #4-20 Plastite screws from the board UNDERSIDE into dia 2.79 blind holes 8.0 deep at (+/-10.67, +/-13.6) (.840 [21.34] x 1.071 [27.2]); TE recommends dia 3.43 +0.13 -> NPTH 3.5; dia 6.6 bosses on the connector face, screw heads on B.Cu (B.CrtYd circles). Body/flange outline 35.26 x 55.12 on the board; flange face 15.52 above the PCB, shroud to 30.1, pins 3.1 below; panel: 2x dia 3.3 #6-19 holes on 45.21 (sheet 1). Mates DT06-08SX plug + W8S wedgelock, size-16 contacts 13 A. TE 'Amostras disponiveis' 2026-09-23: -08PD yes (its plug DT06-08SD no), -08PA no (plug DT06-08SA yes).")
